  "description": "Kwon Yeong, who passed the highest-level civil service exam at a young age and dreamed of a brilliant future. Suddenly, he manifests as an “Yin,” and his entire world comes crashing down. It was an era when Yin were treated poorly. Just as Yeong was about to be sold off to become the concubine of an old lecher or the wife of a butcher, a marriage proposal arrives from Hwan, his close friend and mischievous companion... \n\n*“I’ll even call you ‘husband’! I’ll just be your wife, won’t I?”* \n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
